    family-names: Betke
    affiliation: Polizei Berlin
repository-code: 'https://git.zeitvertreib.vip/AlexInABox/wallbreaker'
abstract: >
  Portable ESP32-based passive Wi-Fi signal analysis system
  for locating active WLAN-capable devices during police
  search operations. A no_std Rust firmware on the
  microcontroller captures 802.11 packets in monitor mode
  and streams source MAC, destination MAC and RSSI metadata
  over BLE to a Flutter mobile application.
keywords:
  - wifi
  - signal-analysis
  - esp32
  - monitor-mode
  - rust
  - flutter
